sequenceDiagram
Title: Derivation of Keys after upgrade

participant c as Client_v2
participant hwc as HwCrypto

Note over c,hwc: client uses stored generated_policy_1 to re-derive clear_aKey_ver_1

c->>+hwc: deriveDicePolicyBoundKey(derivationKey=DEVICE_BOUND_KEY, policy=generated_policy_1)
hwc-->>-c: (opaqueDerivationKey1, policyCurrent=False)

c->>+hwc: deriveKey(derivationKey=opaqueDerivationKey1, keyParameters=keySize, context="aKey")
hwc-->>-c: (clear_aKey_ver_1)

Note over c,hwc: policyCurrent=FALSE: client is expected to rotate its secrets: <br/>generating a new root key (aKey_ver_2) to reencrypt its secrets
c->>+hwc: deriveCurrentDicePolicyBoundKey(derivationKey=DEVICE_BOUND_KEY)
hwc-->>-c: (opaqueDerivationKey2, generated_policy_2)

c->>+hwc: deriveKey(derivationKey=opaqueDerivationKey2, keyParameters=keySize, context="aKey")
hwc-->>-c: (clear_aKey_ver_2)
